{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to No Mercy Maze. Stay sharp, the path wears you down over time, and the traps won\u2019t wait for you to catch your breath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060210/extras/36e76fc1e025ac2e266e5cfbdc9201f1.poster.avif?t=1759770395\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060210/extras/36e76fc1e025ac2e266e5cfbdc9201f1.webm?t=1759770395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outsmart the maze, or will it be too much for you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060210/extras/fc866d7affe9bb16fec0611dae276c63.poster.avif?t=1759770395\" width=800 height=451 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060210/extras/fc866d7affe9bb16fec0611dae276c63.webm?t=1759770395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a logic-driven puzzle challenge that demands both mental sharpness and\u00a0mechanical precision. where every level is a psychological test. You must memorize,\u00a0go through shifting walls, react under pressure, and navigate floating platforms where only  one path is safe. Each maze escalates in complexity, introducing new trap logic, time constraints, and visual misdirection. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4060210?t=1759770395","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060210/f3f1a497271f58dd88fad2edf65bb820ddc78c74/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759770395","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060210/5c4fc3beb2e940fe5749a783a0d7df19545b65a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759770395","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060210/5c4fc3beb2e940fe5749a783a0d7df19545b65a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759770395","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to No Mercy Maze. Stay sharp, the path wears you down over time, and the traps won\u2019t wait for you to catch your breath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060210/extras/36e76fc1e025ac2e266e5cfbdc9201f1.poster.avif?t=1759770395\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060210/extras/36e76fc1e025ac2e266e5cfbdc9201f1.webm?t=1759770395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outsmart the maze, or will it be too much for you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060210/extras/fc866d7affe9bb16fec0611dae276c63.poster.avif?t=1759770395\" width=800 height=451 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060210/extras/fc866d7affe9bb16fec0611dae276c63.webm?t=1759770395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a logic-driven puzzle challenge that demands both mental sharpness and\u00a0mechanical precision. where every level is a psychological test. You must memorize,\u00a0go through shifting walls, react under pressure, and navigate floating platforms where only  one path is safe. Each maze escalates in complexity, introducing new trap logic, time constraints, and visual misdirection. </p>","developers":["T4GO"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060210/4e183e4c50c81ab3066e229882c3f5386ebd1efc/header.jpg?t=1759770395","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 NINO. All Rights Reserved.  <br />\r\nNo Mercy Maze\u2122 is a trademark of T4GO.  <br />\r\nIncludes free licensed assets with attribution provided in-game.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4060210/2602959/3079d87b4b79000855faecf8c9f12a93e45a8e78/1758745607/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759770393","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4060210/2602959/3079d87b4b79000855faecf8c9f12a93e45a8e78/1758745607/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759770393","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4060210/2602959/3079d87b4b79000855faecf8c9f12a93e45a8e78/1758745607/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759770393","id":257205662,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257205662/movie480.mp4?t=1759770393","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257205662/movie_max.mp4?t=1759770393"},"name":"NO MERCY MAZE- TRAILER","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257205662/da8afb7dd83591ae3639f523c48c7f7e36627500/movie_600x337.jpg?t=17597703